uniform mat2x4 expected -0.16999996 -0.78999996 -0.74 1.1500001 1.59 0.72 1.32 1.98
uniform float tolerance 3.3514774e-05
draw rect ortho 20 0 4 4
probe rect rgba (0, 0, 4, 4) (0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)
probe rect rgba (4, 0, 4, 4) (0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)
